ood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\" rowspan=\"9\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Battleworn_Shield_of_Cyre.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Battleworn_Shield_of_Cyre.png/420px-Battleworn_Shield_of_Cyre.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"512\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Battleworn_Shield_of_Cyre.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001616700</span>1,616<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;7<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Special_event_items#Other_Special_Event_Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">DM unique prize</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Darkwood\" title=\"Darkwood\">Darkwood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Darkwood\" title=\"Darkwood\">Darkwood</a>:</b> <b>Darkwood</b> is an unusually light and hardy type of wood. It is half the weight of normal wood, but +1 hardness. Armor check penalty reduced by 2.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Twilight_(enchantment)#Twilight\" title=\"Twilight (enchantment)\"> Twilight</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Twilight_(enchantment)#Twilight\" title=\"Twilight (enchantment)\"> Twilight</a>:</b> This suit of armor, favored by <a href=\"/page/Eladrin\" title=\"Eladrin\">eladrin</a> spellcasters, becomes semi-incorporeal when donned. The twilight armor reduces the chance of <a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">arcane spell failure</a> by -10%.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>Very few items survived the destruction of Cyre but this battered shield was recovered by an expedition into the Mournlands.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Note: This is a rare special item distributed to certain players in recognition of their efforts in Dungeons &amp; Dragons Online. The shield was mailed or traded directly to the player by a Turbine employee. It is not known how many shields have been distributed. This item is also available for distribution during events supported by the DDO community team.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817200939\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.132 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4144/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29920/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8249/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n119.98%  137.777     50 Template:IO\n100.00%  114.834      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  114.834      1 -total\n 95.68%  109.870      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 41.53%   47.694      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.65%   46.684      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.39%   44.085      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 